blica.pt/1s/2000/12/286a00/70857157.pdf)](https://files.diariodarepublica.pt/1s/2000/12/286a00/70857157.pdf)](https://files.diariodarepublica.pt/1s/2000/12/286a00/70857157.pdf)](https://files.diariodarepublica.pt/1s/2000/12/286a00/70857157.pdf)](https://files.diariodarepublica.pt/1s/2000/12/286a00/70857157.pdf)](https://files.diariodarepublica.pt/1s/2000/12/286a00/70857157.pdf)

